## 1. Request (verbatim)

> "Our customers want to export invoices to CSV. Add that to the billing page." (owner, 2026-10-30)

Deliverables:
- D1: Server-side CSV export of the caller's organization's invoices.
- D2: An export control on the billing page that calls D1.

Suggestions, NOT in scope: filters, XLSX, scheduled exports, emailing exports.

